# ---------------- Personal and local data ----------------
# Upshift keeps its data in %LocalAppData%\Upshift, outside this folder. These patterns keep a copy of any of it
# (and any key or local override) out of the repository if it's ever placed here. The data folders are anchored
# to the top of the repo: Git ignores case on Windows, and src/Upshift.Core has Components/ and Artwork/ folders.
settings.json
settings.local.json
*.local.json
appsettings.*.json
library.json
launch-options.json
install-preferences.json
exe-overrides.json
remote-catalog.json
/user-files/
/components/
/github-cache/
/artwork/
/wiki-cache/
/catalog/
/pending/
/optiscaler-wiki/
*.log
logs/
*.env
.env*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
secrets.json
*secret*
*apikey*

